stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle: No snapshot or search
  Loading: Loading follow-ups, query retained
  Ready: Matching loaded leads, count and current page
  Refused: Read unavailable, controls hidden
  Disposed: Panel removed permanently
  Idle --> Loading: Read snapshot
  Idle --> Ready: Mount receives snapshot
  Ready --> Loading: Refresh
  Loading --> Ready: Snapshot arrives, retain query, reset page
  Loading --> Refused: Read fails
  Refused --> Loading: Retry
  Ready --> Ready: Change query or owner, reset page
  Ready --> Ready: Clear search, reset page, focus input
  Ready --> Ready: Next or previous page in server order
  Ready --> Idle: Idle or session retires, clear query
  Loading --> Idle: Session retires, reject late read
  Ready --> Disposed: Dispose
  Loading --> Disposed: Dispose during read
  Disposed --> Disposed: Late update or repeated dispose
  %% never Search performs a business read.
  %% never Render reasons as search subjects.
  %% never Restore a disposed panel.
